  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Pda 101.38 “State tidal waters” means “state tidal waters” as defined in RSA 12-G:2, XXIII-b, namely, “any harbor, or other tidal waters within the state.”\n\nSource. #8760, eff 11-18-06 (formerly Pda 101.20)",
